    },
    {
      "id": "lore-p01252",
      "text": "First Echo → Thread → First Relay → Keepers and Witnesses → Courts of Continuation → Seed Auditors → synchronization and save records. This is a succession of functions, not one immortal person.",
      "style": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "sourceParagraph": 1252
    },
    {
      "id": "lore-p01251-catalistym",
      "text": "Catalistym · development context",
      "style": "HEADING_2"
    },
    {
      "id": "lore-p01251-catalistym-context",
      "text": "The Catalistym is a proposed contributing history alongside this succession of functions, not an uninterrupted personal lineage connecting every institution.",
      "style": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
